	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>

	<#ff8400>UNIQUE TRAIT: WINGS OF THE PHOENIX</>
	Tui can only use his Remix moves if he has a Wing available.
	Whenever Tui uses a Ground Remix or an Air Remix, that move's Wing
	is used. To restore a Grounded Wing, he must go into the air.
	To restore an Air Wing, he must touch the ground.

	<#ff8400>UNIQUE MOVES</>
HEAVY FLAME	-		_F^C
SWEEP	-		(CAN BE HELD) _DF^C
   <#bbbbbb>Launches enemies higher when held.</>











