   <#bbbbbb>You can hold Up or Down to change Tui's trajectory.</>
RETREAT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _B^Z
BLAST KICK	-		_D^Z 
PHOENIX DESCENT	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _D^Z
CANCEL	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR) ^Z
   <#bbbbbb>This can also be performed during any of the followups.</>



