<#ff8400>PHOENIX REVIVAL</>	-		<#55ffff>(6 BARS)</> ON DEATH </>
   <#bbbbbb>Tui enters the Phoenix Revival state if he dies while at 6 Bars.
   Tui no longer takes damage in this state, but his meter will slowly drain,
   and it drains faster while he's getting hit. If his meter empties out,
   he will instantly die. While in this state, all EX moves cost no meter,
   and Tui loses access to all Super Moves except for Final Phoenix.
<#ff8400>FINAL PHOENIX</>		(PHOENIX REVIVAL) <#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _D_DF_F_-^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A stronger version of Phoenix Dive. If this move doesn't defeat the enemy,
   Tui will immediately die after using it.</>

